    {
      "name": "Toxic Bite",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "virulent"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The blue-ringed octopus has a creature Grabbed</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The blue-ringed octopus makes a beak Strike against the grabbed creature. If it hits, it injects additional poison, causing its venom to gain the virulent trait.</p>",
